    "description": "Mineral, Crystal, and Fossil Collection Lot\nMixed Gemstones, Carvings, Tumbled Stones, and Authenticated Fossils\nNatural Minerals and Fossil Specimens\nA diverse mixed lot of natural mineral specimens, carved decorative stones, polished gemstone palm stones, and authentic fossils. This collection features a variety of lapidary styles alongside genuine paleontological specimens, making it suitable for display, study, or lapidary collecting.\nItems Included:\nThree Late Eocene fossil seed cones (aggregate fruit) from Sahara Desert, Morocco, with FossilEra box and identification card (#277,772)\nPolished ammonite fossil half displaying visible internal septa and chambers\nCarved black stone cat figurine and small carved stone mushroom\nPolished puffy gemstone hearts including rose quartz, tiger's eye, and sodalite\nPolished tiger's eye sphere and polished palm stones including malachite, lapis lazuli, and carnelian\nNatural raw minerals including pyrite cluster, rough quartz chips, points, and obsidian\nCondition:\nNatural geological and fossil specimens show inherent natural inclusions, surface texture, and matrix variations. Polished pieces retain smooth reflective surfaces with no major post-production cracks or chips. FossilEra box and specimen card remain intact and legible.\nMerchandise is sold As Is. Returns will only be accepted with prior authorization and under the terms stated in this Return Policy. If you have questions regarding the quality or authenticity of this item please contact Goodwill of Silicon Valley at 408-869-9262 prior to placing your bid. Items may be returned within seven (7) days of receipt if the merchandise was damaged during shipping or if there was a major distortion in the description. Returns will not be accepted without prior authorization. PLEASE NOTE THAT WE DO NOT REFUND SHIPPING AND HANDLING\nCHARGES. Items selected for pick up from the seller, must be picked up within thirty (30) days from close of auction.